      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHIFTY BULLDOZER (4) is a capable type and proved too classy last time to win by 2.5 lengths at this track in a handy 22.70 beating Pay Time. Has hit winning form and can go on with it. ELITE DOM (1) goes very well here starting 45 times for 17 wins and 12 minors. Below best last time at this track (23.87) in a NG, finishing a 15 length sixth. With even luck and a clean start can sneak into the finish. PHOENIX VIOLET (8) jumped from this box last time and also the same course and distance when a 8 length third (23.26) in a Grade 4/5. Worth following up. STEW BOB (2) picked up an unexpected cheque last time and is in the mix again.",
